
@startuml
title HappyTails - Application Status Diagram

hide empty description

[*] --> SUBMITTED : Applicant submits application

SUBMITTED --> WAITING : Valid / others ahead
SUBMITTED --> YOUR_TURN : Valid / first in queue
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : Validation failed

WAITING --> YOUR_TURN : Previous applicants removed
WAITING --> WITHDRAWN : Applicant withdraws
WAITING --> REJECTED : Staff rejects / animal adopted

YOUR_TURN --> WALK_SCHEDULED : Applicant books walk
YOUR_TURN --> EXPIRED : 48h deadline expired
YOUR_TURN --> WITHDRAWN : Applicant withdraws
YOUR_TURN --> REJECTED : Staff rejects

WALK_SCHEDULED --> APPROVED : Staff approves
WALK_SCHEDULED --> REJECTED : Staff rejects
WALK_SCHEDULED --> WITHDRAWN : Applicant withdraws

WALK_SCHEDULED --> YOUR_TURN : Cancel walk [before deadline]

APPROVED --> COMPLETED : Animal handed over
APPROVED --> WITHDRAWN : Approved applicant withdraws
note right of APPROVED
  If an approved applicant withdraws:
  - Application becomes WITHDRAWN.
  - Animal becomes AVAILABLE again.
  - Next applicant becomes YOUR_TURN.
  - A new 48h deadline starts.
end note

COMPLETED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
WITHDRAWN --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]

note right of WAITING
  When an application is APPROVED:
  - Other applicants remain WAITING.
  - If adoption fails, the queue continues.
  - When adoption is COMPLETED,
    remaining applications become REJECTED.
  - Rejection reason:
    "Animal adopted by another applicant."
end note

note right of YOUR_TURN
  When a walk is cancelled:
  - Applicant returns to YOUR_TURN.
  - Original 48h deadline is preserved.
  - Deadline is NOT restarted.
end note

@enduml
